      "value": "Currently, I am no longer even able to use VR without getting the error robot. I spawn in with it, and I can not switch out of it at all.\n\nJust like before, everything works fine the moment I go into desktop mode...\n\nWhat could cause this? Even with a clean install after removing any and all files (including pictures) that are related to VRC",
