  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "01/09/2023\n\nSo it looks like every time I get into VR mode and turn on my FBT, I get forced into the error robot model. I can't even switch to another avatar let alone get back to my chosen avatar after turning off FBT. \n\nEverything works fine when I get into desktop mode however.. Everytime I try to get back into VR without FBT on or even connected, I am permanently stuck in the robot. What gives?\n\nIt almost seems like after I remove all the files and verify them, everything works just fine, BUT the moment it detects that Im trying to use FBT, it puts me back into the robot. Zero idea why it's happening all of a sudden",
